{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shadows Beneath the Dust</strong> is a co-operative multiplayer horror game set in the wild west. You and your crew will delve deep into procedurally-generated mineshafts to extract riches beyond your wildest dreams (or a lot of coal) and uncover the monsters lurking within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588230/extras/TheJobBanner.png?t=1742616646\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are tasked with exploring foreclosed mines that are supposedly filled with riches, but rumours have been spreading about the creatures hidden deep within them. You and your crew have 3 days to extract as many valuable goods as you can before your time runs out, the train heads for the next mine on its own whether you're on it or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588230/extras/TheJob_Thin.gif?t=1742616646\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588230/extras/YourCrewBanner.png?t=1742616646\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadows Beneath the Dust is a multiplayer game where you'll be visiting different mines with your crew to extract resources. With proximity based voice-chat and text-chat, plan your trip through the mines carefully, bringing with you any items that you might need to mine, find your way through the dark and protect yourself from the dangers within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588230/extras/YourCrew.png?t=1742616646\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588230?t=1742616646","background_raw":"https://share